1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Sh-shut up! This is my first time fighting a monster.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
How can you be so stupid?

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Don't call me stupid!

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:21,000
You've never fought a monster, but you wander into a forest? That's just plain stupid! What were you thinking?

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
What? Now you're crying?

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Geez!

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
What?

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:45,000
If you're afraid of getting hurt, then there's no way you'll get stronger! No pain, no gain, right?

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:55,000
You want me to teach you? Who's your opponent? I'll train you so you can beat him in less than a month!

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
I've been waiting.

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
For me? Really?

12
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Yeah, that move you taught me was amazing! You should have seen the look on Hugo's face!

13
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:17,000
It's scary how much you've improved!

14
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Then tell me your name!

15
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Okay. If you can beat me.

16
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,000
What happened?

17
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:38,000
I know I can win now, but where did she go?
